p.mod:
after the definition of “the 2006 Act” insert—



address claimed as the qualifying address, in relation to a person applying to be registered, means the address in respect of which the person is applying to be registered;


								;

after the definition of “data” insert—



declaration of local connection has the same meaning as in section 7B(1) of the 1983 Act

Section 7B was inserted by section 6 of the Representation of the People Act 2000 (c. 2) and amended by section 14(1)(a)(ii) of the Northern Ireland (Miscellaneous Provisions) Act 2014 and paragraph 1(3)(a) of Schedule 8 to the Elections Act 2022 . There are other amendments to section 7B, but none is relevant. For the meaning of “the 1983 Act”, see regulation 3(1) of S.I. 2008/1741.
											;


								;

after the definitions of “local elector” and “local election” insert—



mental hospital has the meaning given in section 7(6) of the 1983 Act

Section 7 was substituted by section 4 of the Representation of the People Act 2000. There are amendments to section 7(6), but none is relevant.
											;


								;

after the definition of “overseas elector” insert—



previous registration condition has the same meaning as in section 1A(2) of the 1985 Act

1985 c. 50. Section 1A was substituted by section 14(1) of the Elections Act 2022.
											;





previous residence condition has the same meaning as in section 1A(3) of the 1985 Act;


								;

content.p:
in sub-paragraph (b), for “section 2” substitute “section 1C

Section 1C was substituted by section 14(1) of the Elections Act 2022.
									”;

sections 1C(1)(f) and 1E(1)(e) of the Representation of the People Act 1985

Sections 1C, 1D and 1E were substituted by section 14(1) of the Elections Act 2022. See section 202(1) of the Representation of the People Act 1983, as read with section 27(2) of the Representation of the People Act 1985, for the meaning of “prescribed”.
									;

section 34(4) and (6) of the Northern Ireland Act 1998

1998 c. 47.
									;

sections 58(1) and 154(5) of the Police Reform and Social Responsibility Act 2011

2011 c. 13. Section 58(1) was amended by S.I. 2021/1265. Section 154(5) was amended by S.I. 2014/268 and 2021/1265.
									;
